---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: About us
permalink: /about-us/
quote: >-
  The Architected Intelligent Matter (AIM) Laboratory is a research group in the
  <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/aeronautics/">Department of Aeronautics</a> at Imperial
  College London, on the South Kensington campus. The group was founded at the University of
  Houston in 2021 and moved to Imperial in 2026. Our <a href="/research/vision/">research vision</a>
  describes what we work on; the <a href="/research/">projects</a> and
  <a href="/publications/">publications</a> document the results, and the studio side of the lab
  explores the same ideas <a href="/gallery/">through the practice of art</a>.
---
{#- The opening statement is the front matter `quote`, set as a quote block by
    the page layout. Photos come from src/team/about-photos/ (see
    _data/aboutPhotos.js): one carousel per folder, grouped under chapter
    headings. The group's values are on the Team page. What the lab works on
    lives on the research vision page; this page is about the group. -#}
{% from "partials/photo-album.njk" import photoCarousel %}
{% for chapter in aboutPhotos.chapters %}
{% set firstChapter = loop.first %}
{% if chapter.title %}<h2 class="section-heading page-chapter" id="{{ chapter.id }}">{{ chapter.title }}</h2>{% endif %}
{% for set in chapter.sets %}
<div class="page-photos">
  {{ photoCarousel(set, "/assets/img/about/", "about-" + (set.name or "photos"), firstChapter and loop.first) }}
</div>
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
<div class="page__inner">
  <div class="page__body">
    <p>See <a href="/join-us/">Join us</a> for open positions and <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> for enquiries.</p>
  </div>
</div>
